docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md:111:   > Eligibility is assessed individually. For a Medicare-listed bariatric surgery pathway, the relevant MBS thresholds are BMI 40+, or BMI 35–39.9 with a major co-morbidity; a BMI below 35 does not meet that MBS threshold. Your surgeon must assess the clinical options, risks and suitability for your circumstances.
