docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md:184:> It allows Medicare rebates to apply to your specialist consultation fee, reducing your out-of-pocket cost for the appointment.
docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md:186:> Is weight loss surgery covered by Medicare in Australia? Medicare may provide rebates for eligible specialist consultations and MBS-listed bariatric surgery services when current criteria are met. The relevant procedure items are 31575 for sleeve gastrectomy, 31572 for Roux-en-Y gastric bypass and 31581 for BPD/duodenal switch. Private health cover, waiting periods, hospital excess and anaesthetist fees can affect out-of-pocket costs, so confirm what applies before deciding.
