docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/gastric-bypass-perth.md:236:> Most patients require around 2-3 weeks off desk-based or sedentary work. Physical or manual labour typically requires closer to 6-8 weeks before returning. Everyone recovers at a different pace, though, and your surgeon will provide guidance tailored to your situation. It's worth factoring recovery time into your planning early, particularly if your role involves lifting, physical exertion, or extended periods on your feet.
