1719-+   > **8. How much does weight loss surgery cost in Perth?**
1720-+   > Costs depend on the pathway, procedure, hospital, private health cover, waiting periods, hospital excess, anaesthetist and other fees. Any applicable estimate or range should be discussed at consultation after your team understands your situation. Confirm any Medicare rebate or private-cover contribution for your circumstances.
1721-+   >
